stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Still
    Still --> [*]
    Still --> Moving : push
    Moving --> Still : stop
    Moving --> Crash
    Crash --> [*]
    state Moving {
        [*] --> Slow
        Slow --> Fast : accelerate
        Fast --> Slow : brake
    }
    state check <<choice>>
    Crash --> check
    check --> Still : ok
    check --> [*] : fatal
    note right of Still : Waiting for input
    Still : The resting state
    Still : with a description
